        "id": 100400,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-27T06:50:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1.&nbsp; Put in play, allowing the cards underneath to be purchased.</p><p>2.&nbsp; Any time a card has a T, R, I, B, or A on it, it is resolved at the start of that phase.&nbsp; All T effects are resolved first in whatever order the players prefer (or is it simultaneous?&nbsp; I can't remember off the top of my head...) then followed by the normal Travel phase actions of the players moving their ships.</p><p>3.&nbsp; +1 directly on the ship.&nbsp; A ship's W and D can both be increased or decreased from the number listed on the panel.</p>",
